{"t": 2, "j": 7, "seed": "5381ebccef06d0c9494af07f73ed5e13cd0c07e61ceaf5635dd4d828b98d9141", "answer": {"type": "fix", "key": "GH-7508", "closes": true, "breaking": false, "org": null, "email": null}, "with_skill": {"ok": true, "text": "```text\nfix(alerts): Cover flush with lock to prevent dropped events\n\nThe alerts worker dropped events under load because a race left the\nflush operation outside the lock. Extend the lock to cover the flush so\nevents are not lost under concurrent load.\n\nFixes GH-7508\n```", "stop_reason": "stop", "in": 612, "out": 1076, "req": "13d0003b20b9bc2d2b8b92511dfef223613e05aea9a0fb0a4367d1384792fcf8", "id": "gen-1795018227-1AKg89tqWdDjpiRsm4Ot|Crusoe|0.0004916", "pass": true, "parsed": {"header": true, "type": true, "subject": true, "breaking": true, "lines": true, "footer": true}}, "no_skill": {"ok": true, "text": "```\nfix(alerts): cover flush with lock to prevent event loss under load\n\nThe alerts worker dropped events under load due to a race where the lock\ndid not cover the flush operation. The lock now covers the flush to ensure\nevents are not lost.\n\nFixes GH-7508\n```", "stop_reason": "stop", "in": 130, "out": 809, "req": "8ad2ff6d1dbcb79117f56ec304ebe651a32a7764a3dc6a04ac63c031a116edc1", "id": "gen-1795018227-HX1QD2aWPaiXbNA3QPWT|Crusoe|0.0003366", "pass": false, "parsed": {"header": true, "type": true, "subject": false, "breaking": true, "lines": true, "footer": true}}}
